# The A16 recovery `charger` (critical service in recovery init.rc) is killed
# with SIGSEGV on `avc: denied { execmem }` (domain charger is enforcing, unlike
# recovery/init/ueventd in system/sepolicy/private/twrp.te). After 4 crashes
# init reboots to the bootloader ~20 s after OrangeFox starts.
# Only the recovery sepolicy is built from this tree.
recovery_only(`
  permissive charger;
')
